{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Time 是一款主打簡潔的時鐘小工具，適合喜歡極簡桌面與專注環境的使用者，可自訂小工具樣式、字體風格及天氣顯示。原價 US $0.99，現在<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-266.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂極簡時鐘風格</h2>\n<p>Time 以簡潔俐落的設計為核心，讓時鐘小工具與桌面保持一致的極簡風格。使用者可調整小工具的樣式與字體風格，並加入天氣顯示，日常資訊一眼可見。小工具提供小、中、大三種尺寸，方便配合不同桌面排版與使用習慣，適合希望減少干擾、保持桌面整齊的人士。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-198-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-199-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-200-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-201-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-202-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Time – Minimalist Clock Widget</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/time-minimalist-clock-widget/id1575113906?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T07:04:04.682110+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:45:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:51.761833+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T06:57:23.044458+00:00","content_hash":"95326d17a6a8ad508b275e8ceeb9ef42b61b38397809decfa835443e9ddd4f40","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}